e. Without accurate classification, every other compliance activity is at risk of being misapplied or missed entirely.\n\n**Promise score:** This is very important but it's somewhat \"table stakes\" - it's not innovative, it's necessary groundwork. From a compliance perspective, it's essential. I'd rate it around 82-85. It's clearly needed, well-scoped (joint legal/scientific team), covers current and planned projects. The only slight reservation is the one-time \"audit\" framing vs. ongoing process, but that could be addressed in implementation. I'll go with 83.\n",
