iance risk through automation, and supports the institution's ability to demonstrate conformity. The promise score should be high - I'd say around 82-85. It's very aligned with what I need, but it seems to have a gap in fully covering operational logging (the \"lifetime\" aspect during use, not just training), which keeps it from being a perfect 100.\n\nLet me settle on:\n- Rationale: Strong alignment with Art 12 requirements, particularly automatic recording and traceability; automation reduces human error risk in compliance documentation; immutability supports audit integrity. Minor concern that the emphasis is on training-phase records rather than full operational lifecycle logging.\n- Decision: approve\n- Promise: 83\n",
